   "texto": [
    "In informal responses a recoverable subject can be omitted: **Ved ikke, om han kommer.** = I don't know if it will come. The complete **Jeg ved ikke, om han kommer** form is also natural when speaking and writing. The choice depends on the context and the record, not on a rule that reserves a form to the writing."
   ]
